    {
        "text": "He kneeled on the ground, right hand still clutching the spear planted in the dirt."
    },
    {
        "text": "His body was gravely injured, but he felt no pain, perhaps because it was pulsing from all directions and his aging nerves were too dulled feel it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Or perhaps his skin was too scorched, to the point it could not comprehend the pain, the searing temperatures evaporating any kind of liquid or vapor, his blood instantly hardening to black scabs on his body."
    },
    {
        "text": "His throat felt like it was on fire, with a strangely sweet scent emanating from it, and he suddenly felt a convulsion from his abdomen as something surged up."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Hggh\u2014Aghk\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blech\u2014bah! Kuso, this is so disgusting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_9998_1#3$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_angervoice",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 50,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
