    {
        "text": "Images from mere minutes ago flashed through his mind, and he seized the fleeting opportunity in-between the flames to hurl the spear towards the Rathalos's head."
    },
    {
        "text": "He hit his target, but at the cost of failing to dodge the beast's retaliatory charge."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
