    {
        "text": "His eyes widened."
    },
    {
        "text": "He saw it."
    },
    {
        "text": "A young child raising his bow and arrow, facing the Rathalos."
    },
    {
        "text": "His thin arms trembled, but his gaze never wavered."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_756_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Monster...don't get any closer to Mr. Kashiwau!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am Kazuya! I'm also a hunter of this village!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't let you destroy it! We will stop you here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazuya"
    },
