    },
    {
        "text": "The Rathalos... is injured? By this hunter and a Terran spear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "This hunter... his body is so light, where did he get all that strength from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_756_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're really a brave one, and I'd even call you a proper hunter, but how about we let the adults handle it today?",
        "tag": "name",
