    {
        "text": "The flames blazed brilliantly."
    },
    {
        "text": "At that very moment, another bruised body stood before the Rathalos."
    },
    {
        "text": "She bent down and stretched out an arm, picking up the spear from the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "And then drove it firmly into the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "She straightened her back."
    },
